{"4641930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"DeadWeight: A Lullaby","steam_appid":4641930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A newborn falls. You leap after it. Time freezes.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you is not judgment in life or death, but something in between.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/654fa76c991d4e15b9050a8fae53301f.avif?t=1793728296\" width=480 height=94 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadweight: A Lullaby<\/strong> is a psychological narrative adventure that blends interactive storytelling with philosophical and metaphysical themes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i>Elian<\/i>, a not-so-ordinary construction worker who is suddenly thrown into an impossible moment. A falling body, a split-second decision, and a reality that refuses to move forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time stops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, the game shifts into a layered, choice-driven experience where your decisions shape not only the outcome, but the meaning behind it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/c91fe6195d2fe9b2a9387a23bf597391.avif?t=1793728296\" width=1362 height=734 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse environments distorted by perception and fragmented memories. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will encounter unsettling and emotionally charged sequences that challenge perception, morality, and self-justification, moving through moments of silence, confrontation, and psychological torture.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/11777c14d68a96bd3898c1bfb78ab683.poster.avif?t=1793728296\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/11777c14d68a96bd3898c1bfb78ab683.webm?t=1793728296\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of it all is a presence that guides and helps, yet also judges and punishes. A figure that pushes you toward answers that feel increasingly unbearable.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative<\/strong><br>Every decision matters. Engage in branching dialogues and philosophical confrontations that lead to multiple outcomes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological &amp; Existential Themes<\/strong><br>Explore questions of morality, guilt, innocence, and free will through intense interactions and symbolic storytelling.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid Visual Style<\/strong><br>A blend of pixel art side-scroll gameplay and illustrated panels enhances immersion and emotional impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Conversations<\/strong><br>Engage in dialogues with a mysterious higher being that challenges your perspective.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings<\/strong><br>Your choices define Elian’s fate, and possibly something far greater.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Experience<\/strong><br>A compact, story-rich experience designed to be completed in 20-30 minutes, with replay value through alternate paths.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadWeight is built around:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Choices<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions Under Ethical Pressure<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Side-Scrolling Exploration<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Progression<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tone &amp; Content<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>intense psychological themes<\/strong>, including:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong Emotional distress<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and disturbing imagery<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/d8cd9ebf0129e7180f76dca7cabdb0fb.avif?t=1793728296\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras_big\/d8cd9ebf0129e7180f76dca7cabdb0fb.webp?t=1793728296 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A newborn falls. You leap after it. Time freezes.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you is not judgment in life or death, but something in between.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/654fa76c991d4e15b9050a8fae53301f.avif?t=1793728296\" width=480 height=94 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadweight: A Lullaby<\/strong> is a psychological narrative adventure that blends interactive storytelling with philosophical and metaphysical themes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i>Elian<\/i>, a not-so-ordinary construction worker who is suddenly thrown into an impossible moment. A falling body, a split-second decision, and a reality that refuses to move forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time stops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, the game shifts into a layered, choice-driven experience where your decisions shape not only the outcome, but the meaning behind it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/c91fe6195d2fe9b2a9387a23bf597391.avif?t=1793728296\" width=1362 height=734 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse environments distorted by perception and fragmented memories. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will encounter unsettling and emotionally charged sequences that challenge perception, morality, and self-justification, moving through moments of silence, confrontation, and psychological torture.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/11777c14d68a96bd3898c1bfb78ab683.poster.avif?t=1793728296\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/11777c14d68a96bd3898c1bfb78ab683.webm?t=1793728296\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of it all is a presence that guides and helps, yet also judges and punishes. A figure that pushes you toward answers that feel increasingly unbearable.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative<\/strong><br>Every decision matters. Engage in branching dialogues and philosophical confrontations that lead to multiple outcomes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological &amp; Existential Themes<\/strong><br>Explore questions of morality, guilt, innocence, and free will through intense interactions and symbolic storytelling.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid Visual Style<\/strong><br>A blend of pixel art side-scroll gameplay and illustrated panels enhances immersion and emotional impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Conversations<\/strong><br>Engage in dialogues with a mysterious higher being that challenges your perspective.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings<\/strong><br>Your choices define Elian’s fate, and possibly something far greater.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Experience<\/strong><br>A compact, story-rich experience designed to be completed in 20-30 minutes, with replay value through alternate paths.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadWeight is built around:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Choices<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions Under Ethical Pressure<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Side-Scrolling Exploration<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Progression<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tone &amp; Content<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>intense psychological themes<\/strong>, including:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong Emotional distress<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and disturbing imagery<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras\/d8cd9ebf0129e7180f76dca7cabdb0fb.avif?t=1793728296\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/extras_big\/d8cd9ebf0129e7180f76dca7cabdb0fb.webp?t=1793728296 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A baby fell. You jumped after it. God didn't like that. DeadWeight: A Lullaby is a psychological narrative experience about guilt, judgment, and the weight of human intent.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Turkish<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/f12e1310cc69a7677575a724533ab0d5ab85200e\/header.jpg?t=1793728296","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/3c2857014f06878a894a25cad6f050c57cbc9b55\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728296","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4641930\/3c2857014f06878a894a25cad6f050c57cbc9b55\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728296","website":"https:\/\/kaira.studio","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> windows 8 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 ghz 64-bit intel-compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> opengl 3.0 or directx 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.13 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong>